# Code owners are requested for review automatically on any pull request that
# touches a matching path.
#
# The project currently has a single maintainer, so ownership is global. As
# maintainers join, the per-area entries below are uncommented and assigned —
# they are listed now so the intended structure is visible, not invented later.
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default owner for everything
*                       @cosmeaf

# Security-sensitive paths always require the project lead's review
/SECURITY.md            @cosmeaf
/docs/security.md       @cosmeaf
/audit/                 @cosmeaf
/security/              @cosmeaf
/core/settings.py       @cosmeaf
/.github/workflows/     @cosmeaf
/scripts/               @cosmeaf
/docker/                @cosmeaf
/docker-compose.yml     @cosmeaf

# Governance and licensing
/LICENSE                @cosmeaf
/NOTICE                 @cosmeaf
/GOVERNANCE.md          @cosmeaf
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @cosmeaf
/docs/adr/              @cosmeaf

# Future areas — assign as maintainers join. Do not add a username here that
# has not agreed to it.
# /ansible-web/         @frontend-maintainer
# /agent/               @agent-maintainer
# /ansible/             @ansible-maintainer
# /docs/                @docs-maintainer
